title: "Congestion and Traffic Flow Analysis Using Trafikverket Sensor Data"
authors:
  - family-names: Islam Razib
    given-names: Md Nazmul
  - family-names: Ariful Ahsan
    given-names: Md
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-01-14
repository-code: "https://github.com/NiR920/Trafikverket-Sensor-Data-Analysis"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible data engineering and analytical workflow for historical
  Trafikverket traffic sensor data, covering automated extraction, PostgreSQL
  storage, congestion and traffic-flow analysis, speed-dependent CO2 modeling,
  visualization, and an MCP prototype for AI-assisted database querying.
